// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// A spring that heals fully, once: taken as a single flask whose drinking
// is the engine's own `Mend`, so the spring itself never answers twice.
(
    name: "Healing Spring",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "S",
    ],
    legend: {
        'S': Prop("spring"),
    },
)
